    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Fight in the sky!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/99d12839719a36ba056dc977fcae0b11.avif?t=1746381275\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Combat is a fast-paced WWII aviation game where you race to the finish in iconic fighter planes. Use powerups like machine guns, missiles, and boosters to outmaneuver opponents in thrilling air battles. Speed and strategy will decide the winner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/9aa30e9e2ba54834ec4a784035d213e8.webp?t=1746381275\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/bdef20adf3d1ae1c27967142b32733d7.poster.avif?t=1746381275\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/bdef20adf3d1ae1c27967142b32733d7.webm?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/bdef20adf3d1ae1c27967142b32733d7.mp4?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Sky Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky Combat delivers an exhilarating WWII aviation experience with high-speed aerial combat and thrilling races. In single-player mode, you can compete in championships, arcade races, or time trials across various circuits, all set in the skies of iconic WWII battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/86797cfeb2704e767b89f2d9236a5eab.webp?t=1746381275\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/d97810628c5112f812cb3e42656df84d.poster.avif?t=1746381275\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/d97810628c5112f812cb3e42656df84d.webm?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/d97810628c5112f812cb3e42656df84d.mp4?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of legendary fighters from the US, Germany, Britain, and Japan in Sky Combat, where fast-paced aerial races are packed with chaotic action. Use powerups like machine guns, missiles, and boosters to gain an edge, competing to cross the finish line first. With local co-op, challenge friends in championships or arcade races for a thrilling multiplayer experience filled with iconic warplanes and intense combat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Combat is a fast-paced WWII aviation game where you race to the finish in iconic fighter planes. Use powerups like machine guns, missiles, and boosters to outmaneuver opponents in thrilling air battles. Speed and strategy will decide the winner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/9aa30e9e2ba54834ec4a784035d213e8.webp?t=1746381275\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/bdef20adf3d1ae1c27967142b32733d7.poster.avif?t=1746381275\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/bdef20adf3d1ae1c27967142b32733d7.webm?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/bdef20adf3d1ae1c27967142b32733d7.mp4?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Sky Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky Combat delivers an exhilarating WWII aviation experience with high-speed aerial combat and thrilling races. In single-player mode, you can compete in championships, arcade races, or time trials across various circuits, all set in the skies of iconic WWII battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/86797cfeb2704e767b89f2d9236a5eab.webp?t=1746381275\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/d97810628c5112f812cb3e42656df84d.poster.avif?t=1746381275\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/d97810628c5112f812cb3e42656df84d.webm?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225030/extras/d97810628c5112f812cb3e42656df84d.mp4?t=1746381275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of legendary fighters from the US, Germany, Britain, and Japan in Sky Combat, where fast-paced aerial races are packed with chaotic action. Use powerups like machine guns, missiles, and boosters to gain an edge, competing to cross the finish line first. With local co-op, challenge friends in championships or arcade races for a thrilling multiplayer experience filled with iconic warplanes and intense combat.</p>",
